{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53238","headline":"诗偈 六十三 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 六十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"读（《祖堂集》作「奉」）经须解义，解义始（《宗镜录》卷三三作「即」）修行。\n若能依义学（《祖堂集》作「了义教」），即入湼盘城。\n读经（前引二书均作「如其」）不解义，多见不如盲。\n缘（《宗镜录》作「寻」）文广占地，心中（前引二书均作「牛」）不肯耕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}